'''Kombu Cape''' (岩海苔半島, ''Iwa nori hantō,'' '''Rock Seaweed Peninsula''') is the 32nd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was released in the [[Version 5.4 Update]] and it is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Quite a formidable sub-chapter overall, featuring a variety of different challenges to overcome. The first two stages are the easiest, while the hardest one is either [[Golden Gai]] or [[Leadfoot Drive]].
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Li'l Bun Bun]]: This [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy is a faster and shorter-ranged version of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] used as a peon that drops far less money. At the 1,000% buff he appears with throughout Stories of Legend, Li'l Bun Bun has about 0.75x as much health but 1.25x as much attack power as the 400% Teacher Bun Bun from the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] stage.

